    "inverse_of_3": 5,
    "proof": "If v=Mw and Nv=0, then 0=N^T Nv=N^T N M w=3v. Since 3^-1=5 in F_7, v=0. Thus N is injective on im(M), and symmetry gives rank(NMN^T)=rank(M). A principal K39 block rank is therefore a lower bound for rank(M)."
  },
